Package: com.cysxl.keyboardcontroller
Name: Keyboard Controller
Version: 1.5.8
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Conflicts: com.tomaszpoliszuk.keyboardcontroller
Replaces: com.tomaszpoliszuk.keyboardcontroller
Provides: com.tomaszpoliszuk.keyboardcontroller
Description: A fork of Tomasz Poliszuk's Keyboard Controller.
 Changes how the keyboard looks & behaves in every app.
 * force a light or dark keyboard.
 * swap the keyboard type & the return key type.
 * turn the one-handed keyboard on & off with a swipe down on the 123, delete or return key.
 * swipe down to dismiss the keyboard.
 * show tools beside the keyboard.
 * try any keyboard type in the testing area.
Author: Tomasz Poliszuk, CySxL
Maintainer: CySxL
Icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CySxL/KeyboardController/master/KeyboardControllerSettings/Resources/icons/KeyboardController@3x.png
Section: Tweaks
